{
  "methodId": "diagnostic-posterior",
  "entrypointContract": "function(specification) -> {results: {label: {posteriorOdds,posteriorProbability}}}",
  "basis": "Synthetic development arithmetic, not published-paper validation. Use exactly one priorProbability in [0,1) or finite nonnegative priorOdds. For each independently interpreted likelihood ratio, posterior odds = prior odds * ratio and posterior probability = posterior odds / (1 + posterior odds). Multiple labels are alternative results, not sequentially dependent tests. Reject negative/nonfinite inputs.",
